      "side": 1,
      "message": "We agree, this is odd. We did that because we didn\u0027t find a better way. \nThe problem is that a loadable module can\u0027t register LSM hooks. `security_add_hooks\u0027 isn\u0027t exported and is marked as `__init\u0027 and `security_hook_heads\u0027 is marked as `__lsm_ro_after_init\u0027. So we can\u0027t register new hooks after Kernel initialization. That\u0027s why we had to add these hooks.\n\nPlease, correct us if we missed something. If you know a better way, please, share.",
